  "content": "<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>💎 此資料包已改良礦坑，有更多內容等待探索，盡情享受吧！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>✨ 原版礦坑表現良好，因此我並未更動它們，而是新增了全新類型的礦坑。前往深板岩層探索，準備迎接全新的地下挑戰。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🧨 新增了許多主題房間，讓您總有新事物可看，絕不無聊。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🎨 超過十種類型，每種都有獨特之處，有些礦石含量更高，甚至可能出現生物……</strong></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>相容於世界生成資料包（如 Terralith）</strong></span><strong><br>歡迎回報錯誤、提供建議，或協助開發。我們設有&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fCZQthZJjPc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span> 伺服器，這裡的大家都非常友善！</strong></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/949138580415062017?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/623723?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">相容性</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msMOOMq.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9IxCUYAP/images/bfb9e0f54b08f1018ff643dbdde1c0da7b1cb2bb.png\" alt=\"縮圖\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LQXHEUd.png\"></p>\n</blockquote><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DycIqbn.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1gTe61a.png\"></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iiqmpgHLLcE\" width=\"641\" height=\"377\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/l9VYc8La5mg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"641\" height=\"641\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fhopon